{
    "title": "Hearts: Classic Card Game",
    "description": "Hearts is a classic competitive card game, which is one of the greatest card games designed for four players.It sharpens your brain and makes you relax and have fun! Our Hearts has large and beautiful cards, a self-selectable background and card back, simple and easy processes to understand and amazing artificial intelligence to give you an experience like never before.\r\n\r\nWhat are the benefits of our Hearts app?\r\n\r\n\u2764Based on real offline Hearts game experience.\r\n\r\n\u2764Clear card game interface, pure Hearts game experience.\r\n\u2764AI difficulty rating, suitable for both experienced Heart gamers and beginners.\r\n\r\n\u2764The background and card back can use any pictures of the players themselves, or use the three sets of different styles of card faces ,\r\n\r\nCard back, background we provide.\r\n\r\n\u2764 Game stats are readily available to players.\r\n\r\nSome tips for beginners at Hearts!\r\n\r\n- Try to avoid points as much as possible in Hearts\r\n\r\n- Each heart suit is worth 1 point\r\n\r\n- Watch out for the Queen of Spades - a card worth 13 points!\r\n\r\n- If you collect all the hearts and the Queen of Spades in the game, they will be called \"shoot the moon\" and your opponents will get 26 penalty points each!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hearts is a classic competitive card game, which is one of the greatest card games designed for four players.It sharpens your brain and makes you relax and have fun! Our Hearts has large and beautiful cards, a self-selectable background and card back, simple and easy processes to understand and amazing artificial intelligence to give you an experience like never before.<br><br>What are the benefits of our Hearts app?<br><br>\u2764Based on real offline Hearts game experience.<br><br>\u2764Clear card game interface, pure Hearts game experience.<br>\u2764AI difficulty rating, suitable for both experienced Heart gamers and beginners.<br><br>\u2764The background and card back can use any pictures of the players themselves, or use the three sets of different styles of card faces ,<br><br>Card back, background we provide.<br><br>\u2764 Game stats are readily available to players.<br><br>Some tips for beginners at Hearts!<br><br>- Try to avoid points as much as possible in Hearts<br><br>- Each heart suit is worth 1 point<br><br>- Watch out for the Queen of Spades - a card worth 13 points!<br><br>- If you collect all the hearts and the Queen of Spades in the game, they will be called &quot;shoot the moon&quot; and your opponents will get 26 penalty points each!",
